---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { EMAIL, GITHUB_URL, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Yaocheng Tong" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				My name is <strong>Yaocheng Tong</strong>. I am a Software Engineer II at
				<strong>Airbnb</strong>. I work on the Payments and Financial Data team. I work remotely
				from New Jersey.
			</p>
			<p>
				I own a set of Spark and Airflow pipelines. These pipelines convert raw payment data into
				financial events. The finance teams at Airbnb use these events. I also maintain a part of
				the payments backend that supplies the data.
			</p>
			<p>
				Much of my work makes these pipelines less expensive, faster, and more reliable. I also
				do data-integrity work. This work finds and corrects problems when an upstream system
				fails.
			</p>
			<p>
				Recently, I built LLM-agent tools. These tools do financial data investigations
				automatically. I also work with the infrastructure team to evaluate self-hosted
				open-source models for internal use.
			</p>
			<p>
				I have an M.S. and a B.S. in Computer Engineering from Rutgers University.
			</p>
			<h2>Interests</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Data pipelines and distributed systems (Scala, Spark, Airflow)</li>
				<li>Applied AI: agent systems, evaluation, and LLMs in production</li>
				<li>Backend engineering (Java, Spring Boot) and React / TypeScript projects</li>
			</ul>
			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a></li>
				<li>GitHub: <a href={GITHUB_URL}>YaochengTong</a></li>
			</ul>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
